Output assets/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Dracula"
Type "echo 'Welcome to Auto-Shorts Generator!'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Select your video, draw your crop boxes, and let the cloud do the rest.'"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "echo 'Thanks for using my tool! Happy clipping!'"
Enter
Sleep 3s